name issue_76_session_layer_v2
describe Jittery lossy link with the RTP session layer as libwebrtc: RTCP report timing, RTT floor, receive-statistics jitter guards, packet buffer sizing (#76 groups 3-6)
# Groups 3-6 are parity-only on this scenario: no metric moves against `rtcp v1`/`keyframe v1`.
# Target (#76): the call holds up with libwebrtc's report timing and packet buffer.
seed 1
keyframe v2
rtcp v2
duration 30s
at 0s capacity=3000kbps delay=40ms jitter=15ms reorder=on loss=1% queue=200ms
reverse at 0s delay=40ms
expect video.longest_freeze_ms < 2500
expect video.residual_loss_pct < 1
expect audio.concealed_pct < 4
